{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00428",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.03,
      "end_seconds": 5.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Um, hi, doctor. Long queue outside, but here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.51,
      "end_seconds": 11.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "Yes, come in, take a seat. What can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.54,
      "end_seconds": 14.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "I've been dealing with hives."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.56,
      "end_seconds": 18.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "So, how long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.47,
      "end_seconds": 25.6,
      "duration_seconds": 6.13,
      "text": "It's been going on for two days. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.15,
      "end_seconds": 33.74,
      "duration_seconds": 7.59,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.62,
      "end_seconds": 59.95,
      "duration_seconds": 25.33,
      "text": "It just comes and goes. It settles a little with antihistamines. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. I've also had swelling of the lips, for three days. I mean, as for itching all over, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.32,
      "end_seconds": 63.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "And trouble breathing, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.43,
      "end_seconds": 67.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Not at all, no trouble breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.54,
      "end_seconds": 71.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Have you had any fever, wheezing or throat tightness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.58,
      "end_seconds": 75.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Yeah, no, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.79,
      "end_seconds": 79.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.13,
      "end_seconds": 83.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.91,
      "end_seconds": 86.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "So, is the room warm enough for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.14,
      "end_seconds": 90.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Right, it's perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.92,
      "end_seconds": 94.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Right, what about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.29,
      "end_seconds": 98.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Yes, penicillin. I get a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.07,
      "end_seconds": 101.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.6,
      "end_seconds": 114.5,
      "duration_seconds": 11.9,
      "text": "Well, not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.42,
      "end_seconds": 117.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "What medicines do you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.68,
      "end_seconds": 131.34,
      "duration_seconds": 12.66,
      "text": "Hydrocortisone cream, when needed. I mean, it's Seretide inhaler, twice a day. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't. Well, it's cetirizine, 10 milligrams, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.63,
      "end_seconds": 134.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.62,
      "end_seconds": 136.5,
      "duration_seconds": 0.88,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.5,
      "end_seconds": 154.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Alright, what about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.12,
      "end_seconds": 158.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.93,
      "end_seconds": 163.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Is it all right if a trainee sits in later? No? Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.16,
      "end_seconds": 166.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "I'd rather not, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.42,
      "end_seconds": 170.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.14,
      "end_seconds": 174.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "I, I had a knee arthroscopy three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.73,
      "end_seconds": 188.37,
      "duration_seconds": 12.64,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.98,
      "end_seconds": 192.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.72,
      "end_seconds": 198.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.17,
      "end_seconds": 215.42,
      "duration_seconds": 15.25,
      "text": "I've had eczema for five years now. I just want to get back to normal, really. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest. Um, I've had asthma, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.77,
      "end_seconds": 221.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Mm. So, do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.99,
      "end_seconds": 236.23,
      "duration_seconds": 14.24,
      "text": "Uh, yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.62,
      "end_seconds": 241.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.34,
      "end_seconds": 243.04,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.97,
      "end_seconds": 260.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.37,
      "end_seconds": 266.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.68,
      "end_seconds": 270.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Turn your head to the side for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.41,
      "end_seconds": 289.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Lips look a little puffy, but the tongue and throat are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.94,
      "end_seconds": 307.62,
      "duration_seconds": 12.68,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.56,
      "end_seconds": 310.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.27,
      "end_seconds": 332.46,
      "duration_seconds": 20.19,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, I think we're dealing with acute urticaria, possibly allergic at this stage. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had hives for two days, and no fever or wheezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.43,
      "end_seconds": 336.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Hmm, exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.35,
      "end_seconds": 339.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.14,
      "end_seconds": 341.0,
      "duration_seconds": 0.86,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.53,
      "end_seconds": 376.67,
      "duration_seconds": 23.14,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. We should do blood tests for urticaria. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. We should do an allergy test for recurrent urticaria. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I'm prescribing prednisolone, 20 milligrams, once a day, for three days. It's for hives. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 378.95,
      "end_seconds": 381.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Okay, and I take that after food?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 382.18,
      "end_seconds": 388.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "Write down anything new you ate, took or used before this started, even small things."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 388.27,
      "end_seconds": 408.74,
      "duration_seconds": 20.47,
      "text": "Okay. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if your lips or tongue swell more, or you have trouble breathing. I'd like to see you again in two weeks. I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 410.12,
      "end_seconds": 418.39,
      "duration_seconds": 8.27,
      "text": "So, I take the prednisolone, 20 milligrams, once a day and come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 419.35,
      "end_seconds": 423.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we've covered it. Do you have any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 424.56,
      "end_seconds": 427.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Thank you. I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}